<title>USA: Developers names chairman.</title>
<headline>Developers names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Developers Diversified Realty Corp said on Monday Scott Wolstein was named the company's new chairman, a position he will assume in addition to his duties as president and chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said it designated outgoing chairman Bert Wolstein, Scott Wolstein's father, as chairman emeritus of the company.</p>
<p>The company said the elder Wolstein retired from his position as chairman of the board to pursue business opportunities outside the firm.</p>
</text>
